<title>INDIA: India Mangalore Ref 96/97 1st half net up.</title>
<headline>India Mangalore Ref 96/97 1st half net up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	  174.36</p>
<p>    Net sales	 3,940.73</p>
<p>    Other income	159.73</p>
<p>    Expenditure     2,137.45</p>
<p>    Interest	  1,263.87</p>
<p>    Depreciation	496.01</p>
<p>    Tax		    28.77</p>
<p>Note: Mangalore Refinery and Petrochemicals Ltd (MRPL) said commercial production began on March 25, 1996, so figures for year-ago period are not available. AS MRPL is covered under the administrative pricing mechanism, it has computed provisional retention price, pending fixation of the retention price by Oil Coordination Committee. Final adjustment, if any, will be made as and when the fixation of retention price is finalised by the committee, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
